						<a href="/forum/t-13901262/admin-panel">Admin Panel</a>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4841387">
									

<p>Well, while this idea is indeed fascinating I feel like it's missing something. Personally, I think the best SCPs have a balance of power, advantages, disadvantages, ups and downs. This one is just ups, it is all powerful, was easily found and taken, easily controlled. It was so smooth it was a bit boring.<br />
I think it needs some twists to balance it out. For example, if you change one setting another one changes too in order to even things out (you increase the gravity and the density of things decrease, for example), or only people of specific faith can use and be affected by it, or you have limited &quot;points&quot; to use to make the changes. Those are some quick ideas, you can think of something more elaborate.<br />
There is potential here but it still needs some work. I hope you find the perfect balance to make it successful!</p>

							</div>

								
					
