<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article (with ACS)</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional ):</strong> Science-Fiction</p>
<p><strong>Page Layout (Optional ):</strong> Classic SCP styling with logs on how far down researchers have dug into the program.</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> The SCP is essentially the admin panel of the local universe, for example, the ability to explore the universe in a single program along with &quot;editing&quot;, usually being extremely sophisticated (To the Planck scale)</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Addtional&nbsp;details</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Hide</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> After a world-wide phenomenon wherein the gravity of Earth significantly increased, the foundation investigated the &quot;source&quot; of the phenomenon rumored to be at an abandoned facility, locals claiming that said facility suddenly appeared 2 days ago. The facility was empty, but investigators found a computer alien to Human-made devices. Upon opening the computer, it was found to contain only one program, named &quot;בְּרִיאָה IIV&quot;, translated from Hebrew: &quot;Creation&quot;.</p>
<p>After bringing the computer to a foundation site, the program was put into testing, showing a 3-d map of the universe, with the ability to &quot;edit&quot; certain aspects of it. The map can be fast-forwarded. Upon selecting earth, it has been seen that gravity was set to &quot;1.0294 G&quot;, assumed to be an imperfection after the gravity change 2 days prior. After setting gravity to exactly 1, people reported &quot;feeling some sort of lesser weight&quot;, with it reported to be extremely mild.</p>
<p>After scrolling down ~5 meters, investigators noticed that the program has the ability to manipulate the amount of intelligence a species has. The &quot;Cognitive Factor&quot; for humans was set to 0.00109, apes having their CF being at 0.0084. Investigators set the CF of &quot;<em>Canis lupus familiaris</em>&quot; (dogs) at 0.0079 from the value 0.00204. 2 weeks later, a dog was reported to be able to communicate in morse after a researcher decided to teach a dog international morse code, stating that it was to test if said program worked after hearing of the incident and the dog intelligence change.</p>
<p>Lastly, a notable ability of the program is to change the laws of physics themselves. Formulas of every aspect of physics are editable, known or unknown, including gravity, laws of motion, etc.<br />
The SCP can edit and create, such as astronomical phenomena, time, and the very foundations of physics, all branches of it.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention Grabber:</strong> The SCP is God's Program. Stolen, tweaked, then contained.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Would be nice to get tips for a lot more features.</p>
</div>
